![high](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/high-priority.svg)

When a row is accepted via `QuestionRenderModel` fallback, its posture is `'accepted_source_figure_asset_with_receipt_and_rights'`, but it does not have a `source_figure_asset_production_index` in `source_refs`. This causes the validator check `source_figure_asset_final_display_uses_production_index` to fail. Excluding rows that have `question_render_model_fallback` from this check avoids this false positive.

```suggestion
  const finalSourceFigureRowsWithoutProductionIndex = finalVisualRows.filter((row) => (
    row.figure_asset_posture === 'accepted_source_figure_asset_with_receipt_and_rights'
    && !row.source_refs?.source_figure_asset_production_index
    && !row.source_refs?.question_render_model_fallback
  ));
```
